- name: crazygames
  type: table
  desc: Functions and constants for interacting with the CrazyGames SDK APIs

  members:

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_environment
    type: function
    desc: Get the CrazyGames SDK environment. SDK functionality should only be used when the result is "local" or "crazygames".

    returns:
    - name: environment
      type: string

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_game_settings
    type: function
    desc: Get the current CrazyGames game settings, including muteAudio and disableChat.

    returns:
    - name: settings
      type: table
      desc: The current settings table, or nil if settings are unavailable.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: add_settings_change_listener
    type: function
    desc: Register a listener that is called whenever the CrazyGames game settings change. Registering again replaces the previous listener.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the updated settings table.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: remove_settings_change_listener
    type: function
    desc: Remove the currently registered game-settings listener.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: gameplay_start
    type: function
    desc: The gameplayStart() function has to be called whenever the player starts playing or resumes playing after a break (menu/loading/achievement screen, game paused, etc.)

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: gameplay_stop
    type: function
    desc: The gameplayStop() function has to be called on every game break (entering a menu, switching level, pausing the game, ...) don't forget to call gameplayStart() when the gameplay resumes

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: loading_start
    type: function
    desc: The loadingStart() function has to be called whenever you start loading your game.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: loading_stop
    type: function
    desc: The loadingStop() function has to be called when the loading is complete and eventually the gameplay starts.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: happytime
    type: function
    desc: Celebrate a major player achievement, such as beating a boss or reaching a high score.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: report_game_completed_percentage
    type: function
    desc: Report the player's current game-completion percentage to CrazyGames. The value must be between 0 and 100.

    parameters:
    - name: percentage
      type: number

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: set_game_context
    type: function
    desc: Attach JSON-serializable game state to feedback submitted by the player. Call clear_game_context when the state is no longer relevant.

    parameters:
    - name: context
      type: table

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: clear_game_context
    type: function
    desc: Clear the game context previously supplied with set_game_context.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: show_rewarded_ad
    type: function
    desc: Show a rewarded ad.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: show_midgame_ad
    type: function
    desc: Show a midgame ad.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: has_ad_block
    type: function
    desc: Detect if the user has an adblocker.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and a boolean indicating whether an adblocker was detected.
      type: function

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: request_banner
    type: function
    desc: Request a banner. The container will be resized to the specified width.

    parameters:
    - name: div
      type: string

    - name: width
      type: number

    - name: height
      type: number

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: request_responsive_banner
    type: function
    desc: The responsive banners feature will request ads that fit into your container, without the need to specify or select a size beforehand.

    parameters:
    - name: div
      type: string

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: clear_banner
    type: function
    desc: Clear a banner. Will also hide it.

    parameters:
    - name: div
      type: string

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: clear_all_banners
    type: function
    desc: Clear all banners.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: invite_link
    type: function
    desc: Create a link to your game to invite others to join a multiplayer game.

    parameters:
    - name: params
      type: table

    returns:
    - name: link
      type: string

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: show_invite_button
    type: function
    desc: Display a button in the game footer that opens a popup containing an invite link. This CrazyGames feature is deprecated in favor of Room Data, but remains available for existing integrations.

    parameters:
    - name: params
      type: table

    returns:
    - name: link
      type: string

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: hide_invite_button
    type: function
    desc: Hide the invite button when it is no longer necessary.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_invite_param
    type: function
    desc: Get an invite link parameter.

    parameters:
    - name: key
      type: string

    returns:
    - name: value
      type: string
      desc: The parameter value, or nil if the parameter is missing.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_invite_params
    type: function
    desc: Get all invite parameters supplied when the game was opened from an invite link.

    returns:
    - name: invite_params
      type: table
      desc: The invite parameters, or nil if the game was not opened from an invite link.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: is_instant_multiplayer
    type: function
    desc: For multiplayer games, if is_instant_multiplayer() returns true, you should instantly create a new room/lobby for the user.

    returns:
    - name: instant
      type: boolean

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: update_room
    type: function
    desc: Update the current multiplayer room. The table can contain roomId (string), isJoinable (boolean), and inviteParams (a table of string, number, or boolean values). Only supplied fields are updated.

    parameters:
    - name: room
      type: table

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: left_room
    type: function
    desc: Notify CrazyGames that the player has left the current multiplayer room.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: add_join_room_listener
    type: function
    desc: Register a listener for requests to join a multiplayer room. Registering again replaces the previous listener.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the invite parameters table.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: remove_join_room_listener
    type: function
    desc: Remove the currently registered join-room listener.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: clear_data
    type: function
    desc: Remove all stored game data from the CrazyGames data module.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_item
    type: function
    desc: Get a stored value from the CrazyGames data module.

    parameters:
    - name: key
      type: string

    returns:
    - name: value
      type: string
      desc: The stored value, or nil if the key does not exist.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: remove_item
    type: function
    desc: Remove a stored value from the CrazyGames data module.

    parameters:
    - name: key
      type: string


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: set_item
    type: function
    desc: Store a value in the CrazyGames data module.

    parameters:
    - name: key
      type: string

    - name: value
      type: string


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_system_info
    type: function
    desc: Get information about the user's locale, country, device, operating system, browser, and CrazyGames application type.

    returns:
    - name: system_info
      type: table
      desc: The current system information, or nil if it is unavailable.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: list_friends
    type: function
    desc: Retrieve one page of the current user's CrazyGames friends. Only one list_friends request may be active at a time. The callback receives nil if the request fails.

    parameters:
    - name: page
      type: number
      desc: Page number, starting at 1.

    - name: size
      type: number
      desc: Number of friends to retrieve, between 1 and 50.

    - name: callback
      type: function
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the friends-page table.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: is_user_account_available
    type: function
    desc: Before using any user account features, you should always ensure that the user account system is available.

    returns:
    - name: available
      type: boolean


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_user
    type: function
    desc: Retrieve the user currently logged in CrazyGames. If the user is not logged in CrazyGames, the callback receives nil. Will call the provided callback with the logged in user account.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the user table
      type: function


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_user_token
    type: function
    desc: The user token is in JWT format and contains the userId of the player that is currently logged in to CrazyGames, as well as other useful information. You should send it to your server when required, and verify/decode it there to extract the userId. Will call the provided callback with the token.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the token
      type: function


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_xsolla_user_token
    type: function
    desc: Generates a custom Xsolla token that you use with the Xsolla SDK. Will call the provided callback with the token.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the xsolla token
      type: function


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: show_auth_prompt
    type: function
    desc: By calling this method, the log in or register popup will be displayed on CrazyGames. The user can log in their existing account, or create a new account. Will call the provided callback on log in.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the user table
      type: function


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: set_auth_listener
    type: function
    desc: You can register a user auth listener that is triggered when the player logs in to CrazyGames. A log out doesn't trigger the auth listener, since the entire page is refreshed when the player logs out.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the user table
      type: function


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: remove_auth_listener
    type: function
    desc: Remove any previously set auth listener.


#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: show_account_link_prompt
    type: function
    desc: Show an account linking prompt to link a CrazyGames account to the in-game account. Will call the provided callback with a response table containing either response = "yes" or response = "no". The response is nil if the prompt fails.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      desc: The function takes two arguments, self and the response table
      type: function
